                  <div style="line-height:12.0pt;text-align:left;"><font style="color:#000000;font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;font-weight:bold;">Investment Objective</font></div>

                  <div style="line-height:11.5pt;text-align:left;"><font style="color:#000000;font-family:Arial;font-size:9.5pt;">Vanguard Mid-Cap Index Fund (the &#x201c;Fund&#x201d;) seeks to track the performance of a </font><font style="color:#000000;font-family:Arial;font-size:9.5pt;">benchmark index that measures the investment return of mid-capitalization</font><font style="color:#000000;font-family:Arial;font-size:9.5pt;"> stocks.</font></div>

                  <div style="line-height:12.0pt;margin-top:12.0pt;text-align:left;">

                     <div style="margin-top:12pt;"><font style="color:#000000;font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;font-weight:bold;">Fees and Expenses</font></div>
                  </div>

                  <div style="line-height:11.5pt;margin-top:0.0pt;text-align:left;"><font style="color:#000000;font-family:Arial;font-size:9.5pt;">The following tables describe the fees and expenses you may pay if you buy, </font><font style="color:#000000;font-family:Arial;font-size:9.5pt;">hold, and sell Institutional Shares or Institutional Plus Shares of the Fund. </font><font style="color:#000000;font-family:Arial;font-size:9.5pt;font-weight:bold;">You </font><font style="color:#000000;font-family:Arial;font-size:9.5pt;font-weight:bold;">may pay other fees, such as brokerage commissions and other fees to </font><font style="color:#000000;font-family:Arial;font-size:9.5pt;font-weight:bold;">financial intermediaries, which are not reflected in the tables and </font><font style="color:#000000;font-family:Arial;font-size:9.5pt;font-weight:bold;">examples below.</font></div>

                  <div style="line-height:10.5pt;margin-top:18.0pt;text-align:left;">

